      <h1 style="line-height:1.1" class="has-text-align-center wp-block-post-title has-xx-large-font-size">How Tall is Mount Everest? Official Height in Feet and Meters</h1><p class="mn-byline mn-byline--title">Written by <a class="mn-byline__link" href="https://www.magicalnepal.com/guide/bishal-thapa-magar/"><strong>Bishal Thapa Magar</strong></a>, Trekking Guide at Magical Nepal &middot; Edited by <a class="mn-byline__link" href="https://www.magicalnepal.com/author/sachinsth/"><strong>Sachin Shrestha</strong></a> &middot; Updated 29 Sep 2026</p>
      <div class="wp-block-group is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
